      "ja": "ありみぞ加工；ほぞ取り盤；立て削り盤；釘打ち機またはステープル打ち機（手持ち釘打ち具またはステープル打ち具Ｂ２５Ｃ；木製のケース，箱またはトランクの製造Ｂ２７Ｍ３／３４；接合要素Ｆ１６Ｂ）｛木片を互いに接合することによる長い細片または厚板の製造，例．にかわ付けによるもの，Ｂ２７Ｍ３／００Ｂ｝<br><br><u>注</u><br><br>このサブクラスは接合すべき要素の組立て，例．接着剤を用いるもの，も包含するが，接合される木材の表面に接着剤またはにかわを塗付することそれ自体はグループＢ２７Ｇ１１／００にて扱われる｛特定の半完成品または完成品の製造Ｂ２７Ｍ３／００｝",
      "en": "DOVETAILED WORK; TENONS; SLOTTING MACHINES FOR WOOD OR SIMILAR MATERIAL; NAILING OR STAPLING MACHINES (hand-held nailing or stapling tools B25C; manufacture of cases, trunks or boxes from wood B27M3/34; connections for building structures in general, e.g. dowels for use in building constructions E04B1/38; jointing elements in general, e.g. dowels in general, F16B{; manufacture of long strips or planks by bonding together pieces of wood, e.g. by glueing, B27M3/0013})<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>This subclass covers also the assembling of the elements to be jointed, e.g. using adhesives, but the application of adhesives or glue to surfaces of wood to be jointed per se is dealt with in group B27G11/00manufacture of specific semi-finished or finished articles B27M3/00<br><br><u>WARNING</u><br><br>In this subclass non-limiting references (in the sense of paragraph 39 of the Guide to the IPC) may still be displayed in the scheme.",
